<Slide style={{ padding: 0, background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>04 · 数据资产：原题池分层与许可合规</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 12, paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            候选与正式严格分层：这一层看似不性感，却决定了系统能不能公开、能不能发表。
        </Text>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 22, alignItems: 'stretch', flex: 1 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 18, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>漏斗：候选到正式</Text>
                <Box style={{ alignItems: 'center', gap: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 480, height: 76, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>23,255</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#C8DCF7' }}>道原题池候选</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 14, background: '#8B97A8' }} />
                    <Box style={{ width: 360, height: 76, background: '#3D7BD9', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>人工审核</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#E8EFF8' }}>题源 · 答案 · 步骤</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 14, background: '#8B97A8' }} />
                    <Box style={{ width: 250, height: 76, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFC107' }}>33</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#C8DCF7' }}>道正式入库</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4, textAlign: 'center' }}>中间没有自动通道，全部由人工闸门控制。</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>合规四要素</Text>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 9 }}>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 12, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 4 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>默认不公开</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>原题池每条记录带许可字段，每条记录都带许可字段与来源地址，默认不允许公开，需逐条核对。</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 12, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 4 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>年份只从卷面取证</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>最低年份 2016，禁止用答案或更新日期推断，已据此清理 13,001 道旧题。</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 12, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 4 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>完整性分级</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>完整性分为四级，题干或题图不全时不允许进入解析环节。</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 12, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 4 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>离线可回放</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>采集结果输出为结构化文件，按内容哈希缓存，重跑幂等且可供离线复现。</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 13, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 7 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>采集链路：自动发现 → 校验免费下载 → 文件转换 → 分页识别缓存 → 结构化输出</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>识别结果按「文件哈希 + 模型 + 分辨率 + 提示词哈希」缓存，重跑幂等；缺原答案也不影响采集。</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 8, padding: 12, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 32, background: '#FFC107' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.5, flex: 1 }}>
                教育类项目最容易在版权与许可上翻车；把它做成数据结构的一部分，而不是事后补救。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 44, paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F7F9FC', borderTop: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>高中数学 AI 学习系统 · 技术框架汇报</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>19 / 24</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
